    "sections": {
        "description": "Architectonic Structure is designed for architects, interior designers, construction firms, landscape studios, and creative professionals who want a clean and organized online presence. The theme features a modern layout with dedicated sections for showcasing projects, services, team members, testimonials, galleries, and blog content. It includes a responsive design that adjusts smoothly across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. With flexible customization options, balanced typography, and structured layouts, Architectonic Structure helps users create professional websites suitable for architecture studios, renovation businesses, engineering firms, and creative agencies. The theme is built with optimized code, simple navigation, and essential website functionality to provide a smooth and accessible browsing experience."
    },
